# Scene2-4-2

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐4‐2
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:9_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:第二天，时间依然平静地流逝。|#0204Adv02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到了放风时间，我正随意闲逛时，<br>蕾雅从正面朝我走来。|#0204Adv02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:你好呀，希罗。|#0204Adv02_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅的气色明显比昨天好了许多。|#0204Adv02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是小小的余兴活动，<br>似乎就能让大家换换心情了。|#0204Adv02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:最近希罗的气势大不如前啊。<br>不过这也没办法……|#0204Adv02_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:但如果我真有个万一，<br>到时最值得依靠的，还是希罗啊。<br>毕竟我们是互相切磋共同精进至今的伙伴嘛。|#0204Adv02_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我可不记得和她互相切磋共同精进过……）|#0204Adv02_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:所以想拜托你一件事。<br>要不要和我一起去找典狱长？|#0204Adv02_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:找典狱长？为什么？|#0204Adv02_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想再去游说一次，让它取消魔女审判制度。|#0204Adv02_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:要是大家坚信凶杀案不会再发生，<br>那当然再好不过。|#0204Adv02_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是一想到还有魔女审判这回事，<br>大家的精神就会遭到折磨。<br>我想尽自己所能，守护大家的心灵不受伤害。|#0204Adv02_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:倒是能理解你的想法……|#0204Adv02_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我也曾多次试图直接与典狱长交涉。<br>　但那只猫头鹰根本不听人说话）|#0204Adv02_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（恐怕只能无功而返吧……）|#0204Adv02_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:话虽如此，<br>到底应该怎么办，我自己也毫无头绪。|#0204Adv02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论是对艾玛的憎恶与杀意——<br>还是如何对待其他少女们的方式——<br>乃至于在这座监牢中自己该扮演什么角色、该如何具体行动——|#0204Adv02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一切都在迷雾中徘徊，<br>看不到出口。|#0204Adv02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这么软弱，真不像我……<br>　可是到底怎么做才【像我】？）|#0204Adv02_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，<br>请你跟我一起去吧。|#0204Adv02_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR2
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:不知为何，<br>蕾雅突然单膝跪地，<br>郑重而优雅地向我伸出了手。|#0204Adv02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那动作<br>宛如向公主求爱的王子一般。|#0204Adv02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:我——|#0204Adv02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:握住她的手|#0204Adv02_Choice001| Lock:false ButtonPath:ChoiceButtons/Adv/Bad AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:Act02_Chapter04/Act02_Chapter04_Bad01 ResetState:-

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:没有握住她的手|#0204Adv02_Choice002| Lock:false AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:.Choice2-4-1
@AutoSave DelayDuration:0.3
@StopForChoice Clear:false

# Choice2-4-1

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:21

[PrintTextModified Text:好。一起去找它吧。|#0204Adv02_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:没有必要次次都配合蕾雅演戏。|#0204Adv02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我没有牵起她的手，只是简单地回答了一句，<br>便快步走了出去。|#0204Adv02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

